# LF everywhere, checked out as LF on every platform.
#
# Not CRLF, even though this is a Windows-first .NET repository: tools that commit
# through the GitHub API — Dependabot first among them — write back the end-of-line they
# checked out. With eol=crlf they returned CRLF blobs against a repository storing LF,
# turning every dependency bump into a whole-file rewrite and a guaranteed conflict.
#
# .editorconfig must agree with this file, or `dotnet format` fails on the CI runners.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by end-of-line normalisation.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
